            <div xml:id="d596">

                <pb facs="0668" n="566" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg566"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.113/1514</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Legation to the
                            Department of State</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Aide-Mémoire</hi></p>
                <p>In view of an insurrectionary outbreak in the Province of Fukien, it is desired
                    that the governments and nationals of foreign powers be urged not to furnish the
                    insurgents with munitions of war, airplanes, funds or other material aid that is
                    calculated to give encouragement to the movement, or to lend them vessels for
                    the transportation of supplies.</p>
                <p>These measures are necessary for the suppression of the uprising.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1933-11-27">November 27,
                            1933</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
